* Variant 2: Differential pair with shunt peaking inductors for bandwidth extension
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n3 n4       # Shunt peaking inductor
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
NMOS NM2 n5 n3 VSS VSS  # Differential pair
PMOS PM2 n5 n6 VDD VDD
C C5 n6 VSS
R R1 VDD n7
NMOS NM3 n7 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n1
PMOS PM3 n8 n8 VDD VDD
R R4 n8 VSS
R R5 n8 n6